the I2C/UART links or damage connected circuitry.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Both MCUs have VCAP pins misused as signal nets or left without the required capacitors. This can prevent reliable processor operation and compromises connected communication interfaces.\"\n}",
